#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:1
msgid "Detailed steps on how to install Krita."
msgstr "Krita instalatzeko urrats zehatzak."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:14
#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:18
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Instalatzea"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:21
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:22
msgid ""
"Windows users can download Krita from the website, the Windows Store, or Steam"
". The versions on the Store and Steam cost money, but are `functionally identi"
"cal <https://krita.org/en/item/krita-available-from-the-windows-store/>`_ to t"
"he (free) website version. Unlike the website version, however, both paid vers"
"ions get automatic updates when new versions of Krita comes out. After deducti"
"on of the Store fee, the purchase cost supports Krita development."
msgstr ""
"Windows erabiltzaileek Krita webgunetik, Windows saltokitik, edo Steam-etik za"
"ma-jaitsi dezakete. Saltokiko eta Steam-eko bertsioengatik ordaindu egin behar"
" da, baina webguneko (dohaineko) bertsioarekiko `funtzionalki berberak <https:"
"//krita.org/en/item/krita-available-from-the-windows-store/>`_ dira. Webguneko"
" bertsioak ez bezala, ordaindutako bi bertsioek eguneratze automatikoak jasotz"
"en dituzte Krita-ren bertsio berriak ateratzen direnean. Saltokien komisioa ke"
"ndu ondoren, erosketaren kostuek Krita-ren garapena babesten dute."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:30
msgid ""
"The latest version is always on our `website <https://krita.org/download/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Bertsiorik berriena beti gure `webgunean <https://krita.org/download/>`_ dago."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:32
msgid ""
"The page will try to automatically recommend the correct architecture (64- or "
"32-bit), but you can select \"All Download Versions\" to get more choices. To "
"determine your computer architecture manually, go to :menuselection:`Settings "
"--> About`. Your architecture will be listed as the :guilabel:`System Type` in"
" the :guilabel:`Device Specifications` section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:34
msgid ""
"Krita by default downloads an **installer EXE**, but you can also download a *"
"*portable ZIP file** version instead. Unlike the installer version, this porta"
"ble version does not show previews in Windows Explorer automatically. To get t"
"hese previews with the portable version, also install Krita's **Windows Shell "
"Extension** (available on the download page)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:35
msgid "Website:"
msgstr "Webgunea:"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:36
msgid ""
"These files are also available from the `KDE download directory <https://downl"
"oad.kde.org/stable/krita/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Fitxategi hauek `KDE zama-jaisteko direktorioan <https://download.kde.org/stab"
"le/krita/>`_ ere eskuragarri daude."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:37
msgid "Windows Store:"
msgstr "Windows saltokia:"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:38
msgid ""
"For a small fee, you can download Krita `from the Windows Store <https://www.m"
"icrosoft.com/store/productId/9N6X57ZGRW96>`_. This version requires Windows 10"
"."
msgstr ""
"Kuota txiki baten truk, Krita `Windows saltokitik <https://www.microsoft.com/s"
"tore/productId/9N6X57ZGRW96>`_ zama-jaitsi dezakezu. Bertsio honek Windows 10 "
"behar du."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:39
msgid "Steam:"
msgstr "Steam:"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:40
msgid ""
"For a small fee, you can also download Krita `from Steam <https://store.steamp"
"owered.com/app/280680/Krita/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Kuota txiki baten truk, Krita `Steam-etik <https://store.steampowered.com/app/"
"280680/Krita/>`_ ere zama-jaitsi dezakezu."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:42
msgid ""
"For a small fee, you can also download Krita `from the Epic Store <https://www"
".epicgames.com/store/en-US/p/krita>`_."
msgstr ""
"Kuota txiki baten truk, Krita `Epic saltokitik <https://www.epicgames.com/stor"
"e/en-US/p/krita>`_ ere zama-jaitsi dezakezu."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:43
msgid "Epic Store"
msgstr "Epic saltokia"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:45
msgid ""
"To download a portable version of Krita go to the `KDE <https://download.kde.o"
"rg/stable/krita/>`_ download directory and get the ZIP file instead of the set"
"up.exe installer."
msgstr ""
"Krita-ren bertsio eramangarri bat zama-jaisteko joan `KDE <https://download.kd"
"e.org/stable/krita/>`_ download direktoriora eta setup.exe instalatzailearen o"
"rdez eskuratu ZIP fitxategia."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:48
msgid ""
"Krita requires Windows 8.1 or newer. The Store version requires Windows 10."
msgstr ""
"Krita-k Windows 8.1 edo berriagoa behar du. Saltokiko bertsioak Windows 10 beh"
"ar du."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:51
msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:53
msgid ""
"Many Linux distributions package the latest version of Krita. Sometimes you wi"
"ll have to enable an extra repository. Krita runs fine under most desktop envi"
"ronments such as KDE, Gnome, LXDE, Xfce etc. -- even though it is a KDE applic"
"ation and needs the KDE libraries. You might also want to install the KDE syst"
"em settings module and tweak the GUI theme and fonts used, depending on your d"
"istributions."
msgstr ""
"Linux banaketa ugarik Krita-ren bertsio berriena paketatzen dute. Batzuetan ap"
"arteko gordetegi bat gaitu beharko duzu. Krita primeran ibiltzen da mahaigaine"
"ko ingurune gehienetan, KDE, Gnome, LXDE, Xfce etab. -- nahiz eta KDE aplikazi"
"o bat izan eta KDE liburutegiak behar dituen. Zure banaketaren arabera, balite"
"ke KDE Sistemaren Ezarpenak modulua instalatu eta erabilitako EIGaren gaia eta"
" letra-tipoak doitu nahi izatea."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:56
msgid "Nautilus/Nemo file extensions"
msgstr "Nautilus/Nemo fitxategi hedapenak"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:58
msgid ""
"Since April 2016, KDE's Dolphin file manager shows KRA and ORA thumbnails by d"
"efault, but Nautilus and its derivatives need an extension. `We recommend Mori"
"tz Molch's extensions for XCF, KRA, ORA and PSD thumbnails <https://moritzmolc"
"h.com/1749>`__."
msgstr ""
"2016ko apiriletik, KDEren Dolphin fitxategi-kudeatzaileak era lehenetsian KRA "
"eta ORA koadro txikiak erakusten ditu, baina Nautilus eta haren eratorpenek ho"
"rretarako hedapen bat behar dute. `XCF, KRA, ORA eta PSD koadro txikietarako M"
"oritz Molch-en hedapena gomendatzen dugu <https://moritzmolch.com/1749>`__."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:61
msgid "AppImages"
msgstr "AppImages"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:63
msgid ""
"For Krita 3.0 and later, first try out the AppImage from the `official website"
" <https://krita.org/en/download/krita-desktop/>`_. **90% of the time this is b"
"y far the easiest way to get the latest Krita.** Just download the AppImage, a"
"nd then use the file properties or the bash command ``chmod`` to make the AppI"
"mage executable. Double-click it, and enjoy Krita. (Or run it in the terminal "
"with ``./appimagename.appimage``)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:66
msgid "Open the terminal into the folder you have the AppImage."
msgstr "Ireki terminala AppImage fitxategia duzun karpetan."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:67
msgid "Make it executable:"
msgstr "Ezin ezazu exekutagarri:"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:72
msgid "chmod a+x krita-3.0-x86_64.appimage"
msgstr "chmod a+x krita-3.0-x86_64.appimage"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:73
msgid "Run Krita!"
msgstr "Exekutatu Krita!"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:78
msgid "./krita-3.0-x86_64.appimage"
msgstr "./krita-3.0-x86_64.appimage"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:79
msgid ""
"AppImages are ISOs with all the necessary libraries bundled inside, that means"
" no fiddling with repositories and dependencies, at the cost of a slight bit m"
"ore disk space taken up (And this size would only be bigger if you were using "
"Plasma to begin with)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:82
msgid "Ubuntu and Kubuntu"
msgstr "Ubuntu eta Kubuntu"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/installation.rst:84
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It does not matter which version of Ubuntu you use, Krita will run just fine. "
"However, by default, only a very old version of Krita is available. You should"
" either use the AppImage, Flatpak or the Snap available from Ubuntu's app stor"
"e. We also maintain a PPA for getting the latest builds of Krita, you can read"
" more about the PPA and install instructions `here <https://launchpad.net/~kri"
"talime/+archive/ubuntu/ppa>`_."
msgstr ""
"Berdin da Ubunturen zein bertsio erabiltzen duzun, Krita primeran ibiliko da. "

